Upconversion nanorods anchored metal-organic frameworks via hierarchical and dynamic assembly for synergistic therapy
Wenfeng Guo§, Li-Li Tan† (✉), Qiang Li, Juanmin Li, and Li Shang (✉)
State Key Laboratory of Solidification Processing, School of Materials Science and Engineering, Chongqing Science and Technology Innovation Center, Northwestern Polytechnical University, Xi'an 710072, China § Wenfeng Guo and Li-Li Tan contributed equally to this work.
